ound</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;a\\vee_Tb).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;a\\vee_Tb).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是格中二元最小上界的存在性，不声称给出了其他文献中的 exact-pair 定理。原结论的数学内容未改变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-least-upper-bound","status":"resolved","id":"00ac61bde6375c83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-least-upper-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\vee_T$ 使用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 的同一基础理论与格运算。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-least-upper-bound","status":"resolved","id":"00ac61bde6375c83","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LUB}_T$ 取 [[67-df-degree-least-upper-bound]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\vee_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LUB}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\;\\mathrm{LUB}_T(a,b;a\\vee_Tb).","display":true}],"bytes":1650,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-least-upper-bound-existence]]"}],"outgoing":["00ac61bde6375c83","4ff6c9f